!! Proper noun inflection

!! Erzya proper nouns inflect in the same cases as regular
!! nouns.

!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!!! Male given name for deriving patronyms 
!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
LEXICON PropNameMaleDer-J-0Evich
!! Андрей:Андре
+Der/PatrMal+Err/Orth-colloq:ич PROP_OSH_PATRMAL ;
!+Der/PatrMal:евич PROP_OSH_PATRMAL ;
!+Der/PatrFem:евна PROP_KUDO_PATRFEM ;
:й PROP_KAL_MAL ;

